<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus repo yield rises to 4.56 percent.</title>
<headline>Cyprus repo yield rises to 4.56 percent.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield at a repo auction held between Cyprus' central bank and commercial banks was 4.56 percent on Monday, rising over the average yield of 4.46 percent at the previous auction on April 22.</p>
<p>Yields for the 72.0 million pounds ($140 million) worth of bills sold ranged from 4.40 to 4.81 percent.</p>
<p>Bids totalled 77.9 million pounds for the 72.0 million worth of bills on offer.</p>
<p>($=0.514 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
